# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

ledger is project
ledger purpose "Apply transactions held in enums to an account record, with an error enum; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
ledger target console
ledger version "0.1.0"
ledger language refined 1
ledger standardLibrary 1
ledger allows write console.stdout none
ledger requires none
ledger includesModule ledger
ledger entry ledger.main
